Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Module packages: Lite, Standard, Pro; yearly 15 % less a
 month

The owner (2026-11-02): HexaTech Loyalty and Content each in three
packages (Lite, Standard at 85 EUR, Pro), and yearly billing 15 %
cheaper a month.

- Migration: the plans loyalty_lite/loyalty/loyalty_pro (4900/8500/
  14900 cents), content_lite/content/content_pro (3900/8500/14900) and
  every pair at the sum of its packages; yearlyAmount 12 months less
  15 %; products and features per package (limits, switches, support,
  the new feature ai_monthly_cost_cents for Content's AI allowance).
